{"id": "whispered-waters", "ids": "⿰氵⿱口⿻口乚", "title": "Whispered Waters", "pronunciation": "hū", "bopomofo": "ㄏㄨ", "meaning": "The sound of water flowing through narrow passages or gentle whispers carried by streams", "formation": "phono-semantic", "definitions": [{"zh": "水流細聲，如溪澗潺潺之音", "en": "The gentle murmuring sound of flowing water, as in streams and brooks"}, {"zh": "水邊密語，傳於波間之私言", "en": "Secret words whispered by water's edge, carried on ripples"}, {"zh": "喻指難以察覺之細微聲響或暗示", "en": "By extension, barely perceptible sounds or subtle hints"}], "etymology": "In the spaces between spoken words, where mouth meets mouth in overlapping whispers, there flows a current as gentle as water. This character captures that liminal moment when human voice becomes indistinguishable from the babbling of brooks—a sound that exists in the ear of the listener rather than the throat of the speaker. It reminds us that some communications flow like water, finding their way through the smallest openings in our attention.", "source": {"work": "《廣韻》", "gloss": "呼骨切，音忽。水聲細微貌。"}, "components": [{"char": "氵", "meaning": "water"}, {"char": "口", "meaning": "mouth"}, {"char": "口", "meaning": "mouth"}, {"char": "乚", "meaning": "乚"}], "examples": [{"text": "夜深人靜，唯聞溪水⿰氵⿱口⿻口乚⿰氵⿱口⿻口乚，如訴如泣", "translation": "In the deep silence of night, only the gentle murmuring of the stream could be heard, like whispered sorrows", "style": "classical"}, {"text": "她在湖邊⿰氵⿱口⿻口乚著什麼，風吹散了她的話語", "translation": "She whispered something by the lake's edge, her words scattered by the wind", "style": "contemporary"}], "related": [{"char": "潺", "pinyin": "chán", "gloss": "sound of flowing water"}, {"char": "囁", "pinyin": "niè", "gloss": "to whisper"}, {"char": "泠", "pinyin": "líng", "gloss": "sound of water; clear and cold"}], "tags": ["water sounds", "whispers", "subtle communication", "nature"], "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\">\n<style>@import url(\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+TC:wght@400;700&display=swap\");</style>\n<g transform=\"translate(39.89,83.28) scale(0.328236,0.448614) translate(-302.00,774.00) scale(1,-1)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" paint-order=\"stroke fill\">\n  <path d=\"M 438 711 Q 478 680 523 641 Q 539 626 558 627 Q 571 628 576 644 Q 580 663 569 697 Q 562 724 519 743 Q 420 774 404 768 Q 398 762 400 747 Q 404 734 438 711 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n  <path d=\"M 326 514 Q 402 442 444 427 Q 460 426 470 440 Q 477 455 472 474 Q 453 525 338 557 Q 319 561 309 557 Q 302 556 306 542 Q 307 529 326 514 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n  <path d=\"M 362 145 Q 349 144 347 124 Q 350 39 384 13 Q 391 4 402 6 Q 411 6 416 33 Q 440 100 592 354 Q 602 370 602 377 Q 603 387 592 382 Q 579 376 424 197 Q 385 158 362 145 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(168.73,21.95) scale(0.469662,0.372546) translate(-211.00,652.00) scale(1,-1)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.9\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" paint-order=\"stroke fill\">\n  <path d=\"M 295 571 Q 267 590 236 597 Q 227 600 221 594 Q 211 587 223 573 Q 281 477 292 248 Q 293 176 338 142 Q 339 141 343 139 Q 365 133 365 170 Q 365 174 365 177 L 360 223 Q 327 406 322 528 C 321 555 320 555 295 571 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n  <path d=\"M 719 261 Q 755 472 821 538 Q 845 563 824 589 Q 802 607 729 642 Q 704 652 674 641 Q 515 587 295 571 C 265 569 293 522 322 528 Q 331 529 345 533 Q 493 555 634 577 Q 671 584 685 568 Q 707 549 703 505 Q 684 372 654 268 C 646 239 714 231 719 261 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n  <path d=\"M 365 177 Q 372 177 383 178 Q 495 200 738 212 Q 751 213 754 224 Q 755 234 719 261 C 698 277 683 274 654 268 Q 491 235 360 223 C 330 220 335 176 365 177 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(141.15,219.33) scale(0.344659,0.268313) translate(0,900) scale(1,-1)\">\n  <path d=\"M 295 571 Q 267 590 236 597 Q 227 600 221 594 Q 211 587 223 573 Q 281 477